{"ID":"20240118151429-x3l2oov","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240118151429-x3l2oov","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151429-x3l2oov\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151429-bmtsz8s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119115107-uos4uri\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119115046-332klgz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:172,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:172\u0026#125;","title":"010空青","type":"doc","updated":"20240125093850"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151429-bmtsz8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151429-bmtsz8s","updated":"20240119115030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘寒，主青盲，耳聋明目利九窍，通血脉，养精神益肝，久服轻身延年不老，能化铜铁铅锡作金。吴普曰空青神农甘一经酸，久服有神仙玉女来侍，使人志高。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115005-izfpsjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115005-izfpsjn","updated":"20240119115031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产河南山西陕西山中，色青质轻，近罕见。今名丹青。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115008-k70rm5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115008-k70rm5u","updated":"20240119115031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘酸，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115009-oz79w1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115009-oz79w1h","updated":"20240119115032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】空青为一切眼目要药，主治目赤目痛，青盲耳聋，利九窍通血脉，养神益肝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115011-3ienwt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115011-3ienwt3","updated":"20240119115033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗目赤痛，去肤翳止泪出，利水道，下乳汁，通关节，破坚积。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115013-1znpfl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115013-1znpfl0","updated":"20240119115034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治头风镇肝，瞳仁破者，得再见物。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115015-ss3mz6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115015-ss3mz6h","updated":"20240119115035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】钻孔取浆，点多年青盲，内障翳膜，养精气，其壳摩翳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115017-2u8quo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115017-2u8quo0","updated":"20240119115036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】内服外用，分许至一、二钱，外用点目可以与贝母同用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115018-ay20ji3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115018-ay20ji3","updated":"20240119115037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】勿过量使用。一日点二次即止。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115020-0f7wnhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115020-0f7wnhp","updated":"20240119115038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【炮制】拣去杂质即可。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119115038-hd46sno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115038-hd46sno"}},{"ID":"20240119115039-dbw7334","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115039-dbw7334"}},{"ID":"20240119115039-63y3tpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115039-63y3tpz","updated":"20240119115046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青跟石胆，统统来自铜坑，铜矿。"}]},{"ID":"20240119115046-332klgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115046-332klgz","updated":"20240125093728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么知道是真正的胆矾，你把它拿出来，跟铁一磨，就会出现铜的颜色，这是胆矾。那如果说是空青，拿来也是青色的，那你怎么知道这两个不太一样。为什么叫空青，因为那个青色的石头是空的，你可以看到有水在里面，空的啊，那你就钻个洞，把那个水拿出来，这个眼睛的空，这个空青就像眼瞳孔一样，所以我们就用空青里面的水来点眼睛，非常好。那以后你到大陆去旅游，一看，这个石头，很好玩，有水，那个就是空青，那就好像眼珠子里面有水，用意来取它的药，意来取它的药。前面不是讲吗，我们中药，可以用意念，用意来取它的药，同样象吗，石头里的水，跟我们眼珠子里，眼眶里的水是一样的，所以它这个空青，治疗我们的青盲，眼睛的夜盲，明利九窍，这个药很好用，但是现在，很少见，偶尔在博物馆，石头展览馆可以看到。"}]},{"ID":"20240119115052-secnghe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115052-secnghe","updated":"20240125093737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么有水在里面，拥有的那个人，它不见得知道这是空青，但是你知道，那个水是治疗眼科的。"}]},{"ID":"20240119115102-tqpsh85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115102-tqpsh85","updated":"20240125093751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空青为一切眼目的要药，主治目赤目痛，青盲耳聋，那这个大明啊，钻孔取浆，打个洞，里面的水拿出来，直接眼睛上涂。过去我们中药，最好的点眼药水，是用炉甘石。"}]},{"ID":"20240119115107-uos4uri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119115107-uos4uri","updated":"20240125093850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们怎么用，比如说炉甘石一两，硼砂1两，海螵蛸1两，这三个药，把它打粉，焙制过，烘焙过后，打粉，石类药，我们要用的时候，都烘焙过，首先煅过，在锅里面烧过，打粉，磨细，这是海螵蛸，如果你有空青，用空青的水来浣【huàn】过点眼，那是最好的，色盲，眼睛的很多病都可以治，那你没有空青怎么办，用一般的家里煮熟的水，都可以。这是点眼睛的药水。那如果说，这三个药，点下去，很涩，病人，哇，眼睛很涩，很难过，你加一点点朱砂，朱砂是润滑的吗，加一点滑润剂在里面，就可以点眼睛用的，这是我们很有名的眼科的外用药，当然了你可以用空青跟贝母也可以点眼药的。"}]}]}